        "id": 210948,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-10T10:12:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Jeysie wrote:</b><br><blockquote>... one of the extremely few geeks not also into metal,\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nOh, there are loads of us.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Heh! True. Just feels like eight times out of ten when I meet a new geek on a personal level or find out a geeky creator's music tastes, they're way into metal and/or hard rock. (Which is usually awkward because my music tastes are mostly on the old-fashioned end aside from some outliers.)</p>",
