        "created_at": "2018-01-11T04:50:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You’re not wrong… My best friend was a super metal head in college, and he was always trying to explain to me how such-and-such song was based on a jazz composition, or so-and-so was a classically trained guitarist before joining a metal band.  I just didn’t like it personally, so I was kind of hard to convince. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
