        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-11T14:04:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>@<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/users/trajector\" title=\"View user profile.\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Trajector</a>: I more or less grew up being trained to sing stuff like folk songs, showtunes, choral music, holiday music (and played the violin for a brief spell). So my tastes run more towards that sort of thing (still like folk music and showtunes, also acapella and big band and 50s-80s music), and conversely a lot of metal and hard rock leaves me with a sort of instinctive wincing/cringing reaction.</p><p>So my outliers tend more toward what I'm familiar with; stuff like Nightwish, Trans-Siberian Orchestra, Dropkick Murphys.</p><p>Also I weirdly don't mind electronica.</p>",
