        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d07c76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-11T19:12:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Jeysie wrote:</b><br><blockquote>... one of the extremely few geeks not also into metal,\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nOh, there are loads of us.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I don't know a single nerd IRL who is into metal. &nbsp;Interesting. &nbsp;Punk, yes. &nbsp;Metal, no.</p>",
